      "augment_is": "augmenting chains \u2014 one seat ejected and two inserted in its room. THE ONLY STAGE THAT RAISES THE SEAT COUNT: a 1-swap conserves it. On since 2026-09-04, so a record that does not name the flag ran WITH it and is not comparable to one taken before that",
