      "method": "a stratified view, a greedy seed, 1-swap improvement to exhaustion, augmenting chains, then the 1-swap loop again. ANYTIME at every stage: the gallery is valid from its first seat and nothing here claims optimality. The exact solve it replaced is retired",
      "objective": "lexicographic and strict, in this order: (1) seats filled, every one above its own mode's bar; (2) the shortfall against every demand \u2014 the mode floors and any colour target \u2014 minimized, and nothing padded; (3) the worst seated score, maximized; (4) the sum. The rank quantity is the fitted rank key and not p_ge4 alone. A filled floor outranks the worst seat by ruling: a demand this pool can meet is met, and the price comes out of the weakest seat rather than out of the roster. Nothing guards a met demand because the order itself keeps it",
